<%!-- The engine mounts here. Everything the bundle needs from this environment arrives as a data
      attribute rather than compiled in: the CV's origin, who is signed in, and the CSRF token the
      header's Log out button posts with. An attribute that is nil is not rendered at all, so the
      bundle reads "absent" rather than a value nobody chose. --%>
<div
  id="game"
  data-cv-url={@cv_url}
  data-user-email={@current_user && @current_user.email}
  data-csrf-token={Plug.CSRFProtection.get_csrf_token()}
>
</div>
